.TH FUDDLE 6.SH NAMEfuddle \- chess from a shuffled start.SH SYNOPSIS\fBfuddle\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONA chess variant from the same program as\fBchess\fR:\fRit shuffles -- fuddles -- the pieces into fresh places and plays a game from there.  It asks whether you want white, draws theshaded board with the pieces listed above it, and takes moves as twosquares,\fBe2e4\fR.\fR.SH SEE ALSOchess